    skos:definition "gmeow:TransliterationScheme is RETAINED as the named romanization value vocabulary; the lang: layer regrounds transliteration as a rendering-layer map (lang:TransliterationMap) that names its scheme through lang:transliterationScheme and its source/target orthographies. AffineCorrespondence: the scheme individual is shared across the graft, not superseded — a partial, non-recoverable relation, mnemomorphic false."@x-gmeow-english ;
