    skos:definition "The notation projection-loss ledger is regrounded onto the coarse logic:PreservationKind a lang:renderingPreservation records. LossyLens: the per-parameter granularity of gmeow:ProjectionLoss (which canonical parameter each loss omits) is dropped by the coarse preservation grade, so the crossing does not recover its source."@x-gmeow-english ;
